    {
      "text": "猫咪会自动投掷玩具攻击，玩家只负责控制飞碟移动路线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The cat automatically throws its toys at enemies; all you have to do is control its path!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2778500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "玩具武器会进化成危险形态，并按家族累积专属加成",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each weapon starts as a playful toy and transforms into more impressive and dangerous forms. Each weapon you acquire is associated with one or more families, each offering distinct bonuses that amplify with every point in it.",
