      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "悲伤的主人把最后冒险写成一本书，每个世界对应一个哀伤阶段",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "The entire world unfolds within a book created by Kitty's grieving human so she can experience one last adventure. This book contains multiple worlds to explore, each representing a stage of grief.",
